<!--
  Zákon č. 108/2024 Z. z., § 5(1) písm. l), written in schemas/law.xsd from
  the static.slov-lex.sk version mirror. The words are the Slovak
  legislature's; only the structure is ours. Item l) of the § 5(1)
  pre-contract information list requires a notice about the consumer's
  right to submit a remedy request under the special act (391/2015 Z. z.)
  together with a link to the website publishing information about the
  competent ADR entity. It is Slovakia's closest analogue of Directive
  2013/11 Art. 13(1)–(2) — it applies to every trader at contract
  conclusion, not only to traders committed to ADR.
-->
<law xmlns="https://legalgraph.org/ns/law#"
